        title:"Madison Beer Fan Club vs shreyassaboo",
        analysis:"Madison Beer Fan Club enters 4–0 with the league’s No. 2 power ranking, while shreyassaboo is 0–4. The contrast makes this a ceiling test: the favorite owns the NFL’s early rushing and receiving leaders, but the underdog counters with Lamar Jackson and Justin Jefferson.",
