        "2":{"title":"Zyns in our foreskin 159.72, Packy’s Celery Stick 109.18","analysis":"The second Matchup of the Week became a 50.54-point statement. Zyns in our foreskin posted the weekly high, swept every all-play comparison again and moved to 4–0, while Packy’s Celery Stick suffered the sharpest scoring reversal of the week.","points":[["Final score","Zyns in our foreskin won 159.72–109.18 and produced the week’s largest margin."],["Deciding performance","The same lineup that led Week 1’s scoring followed with another league-high total, preserving Zyns in our foreskin’s perfect 22–0 all-play résumé."],["Lineup swing","Packy’s Celery Stick fell from 171.46 in Week 1 to 109.18 in Week 2—a 62.28-point drop and the week’s largest reversal."]]}
