      var reviewStories={
        "1":[["Quarterback eruption","Josh Allen validates Zyns in our foreskin’s early QB investment","Allen completed 20 of 29 passes for 334 yards and two touchdowns, then added 23 rushing yards and two more scores in Buffalo’s win over Houston. Zyns in our foreskin’s second-round quarterback answered the week’s toughest matchup with elite four-touchdown production.","https://www.nbcsports.com/fantasy/football/player-news/2026-09-13/josh-allen-gets-revenge-on-texans-with-334-2","Read the full Josh Allen report"],["Breakout receiver","Christian Watson wins the shootout for Packy’s Celery Stick","Watson caught six of eight targets for 147 yards and two touchdowns, including an 81-yard score. His 32.70 fantasy points became the decisive individual performance in Packy’s Celery Stick’s 16.46-point Matchup of the Week victory.","https://www.nbcsports.com/fantasy/football/player-news/2026-09-13/watson-erupts-for-147-yards-2-tds-in-week-1-loss","Read the full Christian Watson report"],["Bears history","Caleb Williams drives Tanking My Bigsby’s 160-point opener","Chicago scored 59 points behind a rushing-heavy offense, and Williams paired 200-plus passing yards and two passing touchdowns with 50-plus rushing yards and two more scores. His 37.26 fantasy points were the highest individual total started in the league.","https://www.nbcsports.com/fantasy/football/news/10-fantasy-football-takeaways-from-week-1-josh-allen-and-caleb-williams-go-scorched-earth","Read the opening-slate takeaways"],["New workhorse","Kenneth Walker powers Madison Beer Fan Club’s perfect start","Walker carried 23 times for 173 yards and a touchdown, then added three catches for 18 yards and another score in his Chiefs debut. The 191-yard performance gave Madison Beer Fan Club a new weekly engine immediately.","https://www.rotoballer.com/player-news/kenneth-walker-explodes-for-191-yards-in-week-1-victory/1931567","Read the full Kenneth Walker report"],["Floor under pressure","Puka Nacua survives a difficult opener","Nacua caught five of nine targets for 74 yards as the Rams’ passing game struggled against San Francisco. The target volume remained intact for Beau’s Burners, but the modest result reinforced how little margin the league’s 92.80-point low score had elsewhere.","https://www.nbcsports.com/fantasy/football/player-news/2026-09-10/puka-nacua-catches-five-passes-in-week-1-defeat","Read the full Puka Nacua report"],["Top pick in motion","Jahmyr Gibbs begins as Justin’s Fields of Dreams’ cornerstone","Jahmyr Gibbs entered Week 1 atop PFN’s running-back rankings, backed by elite efficiency and a clearer workload while Isiah Pacheco was on injured reserve. Justin’s Fields of Dreams turned that first overall draft pick into the center of its opening-week lineup.","https://www.profootballnetwork.com/fantasy-football/jahmyr-gibbs-fantasy-football-outlook-week-1-2026/","Read the full Jahmyr Gibbs analysis"]],
        "2":[["Five-score night","Josh Allen keeps Zyns in our foreskin at the top","Allen completed 20 of 31 passes for 248 yards and three touchdowns, then rushed for 69 yards and two more scores. That five-touchdown line powered another weekly high and preserved Zyns in our foreskin’s perfect start.","https://www.nbcsports.com/fantasy/football/player-news/2026-09-18/lions-summon-super-josh-in-bills-home-opener","Read the full Josh Allen report"],["Volume without a score","Kenneth Walker carries Madison Beer Fan Club again","Walker handled 24 carries and 10 targets, finishing with 178 yards from scrimmage even without a touchdown. The workload reinforced why Madison Beer Fan Club could stay unbeaten without needing a record-setting scoring week.","https://www.nbcsports.com/fantasy/football/player-news/2026-09-21/178-combined-yards-for-kenneth-walker-in-ot-win","Read the full Kenneth Walker report"],["Waiver shockwave","Dalton Schultz posts a career target day","With Nico Collins sidelined, Schultz caught 12 of 14 targets for 140 yards. The breakout immediately changed the current-slate waiver board and showed why dependable tight-end volume would command attention in this league.","https://www.fantasypros.com/nfl/news/609414/dalton-schultz-explodes-12-catches-sunday.php","Read the full Dalton Schultz report"],["Injury setback","Caleb Williams’ hamstring clouds Tanking My Bigsby’s next move","Williams suffered a hamstring injury in Week 2 and was considered week-to-week. The issue was not expected to end his season, but it threatened the quarterback ceiling that had carried Tanking My Bigsby’s opening-week surge.","https://www.si.com/onsi/fantasy/fantasy-football-impact-caleb-williams-injures-hamstring-in-week-2-2026","Read the full Caleb Williams report"],["Role holds","Christian Watson scores despite Packy’s Celery Stick’s team crash","Watson caught four of a team-high 11 targets for 41 yards and a touchdown against the Jets. The efficiency dipped from Week 1, but the target lead and another score kept his breakout role intact even as Packy’s Celery Stick fell by 50.54.","https://www.nbcsports.com/fantasy/football/player-news/2026-09-20/watson-scores-td-leads-team-in-targets-in-win","Read the full Christian Watson report"],["Tight-end bet","Dalton Kincaid gives Beau’s Burners a ceiling swing","After a five-catch, 130-yard opener, Dalton Kincaid’s expanded role made Beau’s Burners’ waiver claim one of the clearest upside bets entering Week 2. The move attached the roster to Buffalo’s high-scoring offense at a thin position.","https://www.rotoballer.com/player-news/dalton-kincaid-looks-like-a-top-five-tight-end-in-week-2/1933508","Read the full Dalton Kincaid report"]]
      };
