      reviewStories["3"]=[["MNF stunner","38-year-old Case Keenum fills in for the injured Caleb Williams and stuns the Eagles 27-7","With Caleb Williams sidelined by a hamstring injury, Chicago's third-string quarterback made his first start since 2023 and outplayed Jalen Hurts — 247 passing yards, two touchdowns through the air and one on the ground in a Monday night rout of Philadelphia. Tanking My Bigsby's quarterback watched from the sideline as Keenum joined Ryan Fitzpatrick as the only quarterbacks to win starts for seven different teams.","https://www.nbcsports.com/nfl/profootballtalk/rumor-mill/news/monday-night-football-case-keenum-bears-beat-eagles-27-7","Read the MNF recap"],["Season over","De'Von Achane tears his ACL and is out for the season","Miami's star back went down on an 11-yard run in the first quarter of the Dolphins' 24-10 loss to Kansas City. The 2025 Pro Bowler, coming off a 1,350-yard season, is done for 2026 — a brutal blow for shreyassaboo.","https://www.reuters.com/sports/report-dolphins-rb-devon-achane-acl-out-season--flm-2026-09-28/","Read the injury report"],["Milestone","Patrick Mahomes ties Tom Brady for the most wins through 150 starts","The Chiefs quarterback matched Brady's mark for the most wins by a quarterback through his first 150 career starts. Another line on the resume for Justin's Fields of Dreams' quarterback.","https://greenvillesportsmedia.com/2026/09/28/nfl-week-3-highlights-gibbs-rodgers-and-mahomes-rewrite-the-record-book/","Read the Week 3 highlights"],["Career night","Drake London posts a career-high 194 receiving yards","London hauled in nine passes for a career-best 194 yards in Atlanta's Thursday night win over Green Bay. Been Tuten reaps the rewards.","https://superwestsports.com/2026-top-week-3-nfl-performances-by-players-from-west/","Read the Week 3 performances"],["Staying perfect","Brock Purdy throws for 297 yards and 3 TDs as the 49ers move to 3-0","Purdy carved up Arizona 36-30, hitting George Kittle twice and Mike Evans once, to keep San Francisco unbeaten. shreyassaboo's quarterback is dealing.","https://www.desmoinesregister.com/story/sports/college/iowa-state/football/2026/09/29/iowa-state-football-in-nfl-week-3/92001660007/","Read the Week 3 roundup"],["Rio thriller","Ravens stun the Cowboys 34-31 on a 56-yard buzzer-beater in the first NFL game in Rio","Baltimore erased a double-digit deficit and won it as time expired in the league's first regular-season game in Rio de Janeiro. Derrick Henry's Ravens give Packy's Celery Stick quite the show.","https://greenvillesportsmedia.com/2026/09/28/nfl-week-3-highlights-gibbs-rodgers-and-mahomes-rewrite-the-record-book/","Read the Week 3 highlights"]];
